@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accountId = paste-the-account-id-here

# Amounts are in cents: 10000 = R$ 100,00
# Sending the same endToEndId again is a retry: nothing is recorded twice.

### Receive R$ 100,00 from another institution
POST {{baseUrl}}/pix/incoming
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 10000,
  "endToEndId": "E00000000202610121800incoming0001"
}

### Send R$ 30,00
POST {{baseUrl}}/pix/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 3000,
  "endToEndId": "E00000000202610121805outgoing0001"
}

### Same request again: returns the same transaction, balance does not change
POST {{baseUrl}}/pix/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 3000,
  "endToEndId": "E00000000202610121805outgoing0001"
}

### More than the balance: 422 Insufficient funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/pix/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 999999999,
  "endToEndId": "E00000000202610121810outgoing0002"
}
